    &nbsp; &nbsp; The button below resets the LORA parameters to
    manufacturer's defaults. This may be necessary if communication
    configuration becomes out of sync with the target. Please remember
    to change these parameters for increased distance and increased privacy.
    Note that both tr sender and reciver needs identical parameters to
    communicate.

